WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.050
Ken’s counter Drive Impact crumples Ryu.

2
00:00:04.050 --> 00:00:05.150
Ken walks forward and connects standing heavy punch.

3
00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:06.850
Running Dragonlash carries Ken underneath Ryu.

4
00:00:06.850 --> 00:00:07.950
Heavy Shoryuken finishes from the other side.

5
00:00:07.950 --> 00:00:08.700
Ryu falls after the side-switch conversion.
